        {
          "id": "c7002199-e1ce-420b-b8df-6a3194ecfdc8",
          "author": "UI-Edmundas",
          "description": "Overview\nThis release is available for these models:\n\nE7\n\nImprovements\n\nImproved 6GHz Auto channel selection algorithm.\n\nBugfixes\n\nFixed 6GHz SSIDs occasionally not broadcasting after a configuration change when \"Extended 6 GHz Range\" is enabled.\n\nAdditional information\nIf you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us with some details on your setup and include the below information:\n\nAP model(s)\nPrevious AP release version\nUniFi Network application version\nPlease post a support file as well",
          "link": "https://community.ui.com/releases/UniFi-Access-Point-7-0-107/c7002199-e1ce-420b-b8df-6a3194ecfdc8",
          "publishedOn": "2025-02-01T16:49:46.000Z",
          "wordCount": 19,
          "title": "UniFi Access Point 7.0.107",
          "imageUrl": null
        }
      ]
